Overall is 91%, and overall is the least useful line on the page.

98% on cases a script generated, 80% on cases somebody sat and wrote.
The demos in the first twenty chapters were all the first kind.

The line that should bother you is unanswerable: 15 of 20.
That is the number a plan can be built on, and it is invisible in the average.
